# What the Worker serves is this folder minus everything below (wrangler.jsonc, "assets").
# Deny by default: nothing is public unless a line here lets it through, so a new doc, script
# or config file can never be published by accident. A new public file also goes in
# ops/public-files.txt; tests/assets.test.mjs fails until the two agree.
# _headers is read by wrangler as configuration and is never served.
*
!/index.html
!/404.html
!/app-ads.txt
!/squishy-bop/
!/squishy-bop/**
